description.desc:
Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Eldreda performs up to four consecutive attacks forward, dealing <color=#FF5521>Genesis Flare DMG</color>;
When the heavy attack of the fourth hit lands on an enemy with <color=#FFFFFF>[Gash]</color>, it consumes all <color=#FFFFFF>[Gash]</color> stacks on the target, up to 3 stacks. For each stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Gash]</color> consumed, triggers <color=#FFFFFF>[Maim]</color> on the target once, dealing additional AoE <color=#FF5521>Genesis Flare DMG</color>;
During the third and fourth hits, Anti-Interrupt Level is increased and DMG taken is reduced by 40%.

When <color=#FFFFFF>[Chain Teeth]</color> is available, press <IconMap:Icon_Special> to activate:
Consume <color=#FFFFFF>[Chain Teeth]</color>. Lindverne and Eldreda unleash a high-tier Synergy attack while Lindverne remains on the field, dealing massive <color=#FF5521>Genesis Flare DMG</color>;
After using this skill, press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to quickly chain into the 4th hit of <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack]</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Sharpness is sufficient, press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady_Ep> after the final hit of <color=#FFFFFF>[Bannerbearer]</color>, or after using <color=#FFFFFF>[Dodge Counter: Cold Flame Returning Edge]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Assist Follow-Up: Faith Unwavering]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Ultimate: "This Journey, Onward Together"]</color>, or <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack: Night Blaze - Dawnrise (Modified)]</color> to activate:
Eldreda launches a Synergy attack with Lindverne and Dracaene while remaining on the field, dealing <color=#FF5521>Genesis Flare DMG</color>;
When the heavy attack hits an enemy with <color=#FFFFFF>[Gash]</color>, it consumes all <color=#FFFFFF>[Gash]</color> stacks on the target, up to a maximum of 3. For each <color=#FFFFFF>[Gash]</color> stack consumed, <color=#FFFFFF>[Maim]</color> is triggered once on the target, dealing additional AoE <color=#FF5521>Genesis Flare DMG</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When holding <color=#FFFFFF>[Flag Order]</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_Special> to activate:
Consume <color=#FFFFFF>[Flag Order]</color> for Eldreda and Lindverne to unleash a high-powered Synergy attack, keeping Eldreda on the field and dealing massive <color=#FF5521>Genesis Flare DMG</color>;
After using this skill, press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to chain into the 4th hit of <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack]</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> is triggered, select the character to activate:
Lindverne and Eldreda team up to unleash a powerful attack, keeping Lindverne on the field and dealing <color=#FF5521>Genesis Flare DMG</color>;
When the heavy attack hits an enemy with <color=#FFFFFF>[Gash]</color>, it consumes all <color=#FFFFFF>[Gash]</color> stacks on the target, up to 3 stacks. For each <color=#FFFFFF>[Gash]</color> stack consumed, triggers <color=#FFFFFF>[Maim]</color> on the target once, dealing additional AoE <color=#FF5521>Genesis Flare DMG</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill;
When Lindverne triggers a Daze Chain Attack window, Lindverne can be selected directly to activate this skill.

When a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> is triggered, select the character to activate:
Eldreda and Lindverne team up to unleash a high-powered Synergy attack, keeping Eldreda on the field and dealing <color=#FF5521>Genesis Flare DMG</color>;
After using this skill, press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to follow up with the 4th hit of the <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack</color>;
When the heavy attack hits an enemy with <color=#FFFFFF>Gash</color>, it consumes all <color=#FFFFFF>Gash</color> stacks on the target, up to 3 stacks. For each <color=#FFFFFF>Gash</color> stack consumed, triggers <color=#FFFFFF>Maim</color> once on the target, dealing additional AoE <color=#FF5521>Genesis Flare DMG</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill;
When Eldreda triggers a Daze Chain Attack window, Eldreda can be selected directly to activate this skill.

When the user or the on-field Character is about to be hit by certain enemy Control Skills, press <IconMap:Icon_Switch> to activate:
Dracaene grapples with the monster. If she wins the struggle, she neutralizes the enemy's Control Skill and deals <color=#FF5521>Genesis Flare DMG</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> after Dracaene performs a <color=#FFFFFF>[Defensive Assist]</color> to activate:
Lindverne unleashes a swift forward Slash, then triggers an explosion, dealing <color=#FF5521>Genesis Flare DMG</color>;
After activating this skill, press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to quickly chain into the 4th hit of the <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack]</color>;
Repeatedly press or hold during this skill to keep slashing enemies;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

desc:
Sunbringer's skills all deal Sharp DMG, with DEF used as the skill DMG Multiplier. Some Sharp DMG builds up Gash. When Gash is full, the enemy enters <color=#FFFFFF>[Gash]</color>, which can stack up to 3 times. When certain heavy attacks from Sunbringer's skills hit an enemy in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Gash]</color> state, they consume 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Gash]</color> to deal AoE DMG once;
On a critical hit, Sharp DMG doesn't benefit from CRIT DMG Bonus and uses Laceration DMG Bonus instead. If CRIT Rate exceeds 100% and a critical hit has already triggered, an extra Laceration check is made based on the excess CRIT Rate. On a Laceration, Laceration DMG Bonus is applied one more time. For every 1% of initial CRIT DMG Sunbringer has, her initial CRIT Rate increases by 0.35%;
When Sunbringer enters the battlefield, she instantly restores 60 Sharpness. In Investigation Zone mode, this effect can trigger once every 180s;
When Sunbringer enters combat, she gains <color=#FFFFFF>[Midnight Sun]</color>, increasing CRIT Rate by <color=#2BAD00>40%</color> and allowing her DMG to ignore <color=#2BAD00>20%</color> of the target's DEF. <color=#FFFFFF>[Midnight Sun]</color> lasts 15s. While Eldreda and Lindverne are off field, its duration stops decreasing. Sunbringer regains <color=#FFFFFF>[Midnight Sun]</color> when she uses any <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Bannerbearer - Converging Edge]</color>;
After Dracaene uses <color=#FFFFFF>[Defensive Assist]</color>, the Gash Buildup Rate of <color=#FFFFFF>[Assist Follow-Up]</color> used by Eldreda and Lindverne increases by <color=#2BAD00>15%</color>, and the DMG they deal increases by <color=#2BAD00>20%</color>;
When any Agent in the whole squad triggers <color=#FFFFFF>[Maim]</color>, Sunbringer gains 40 <color=#FFFFFF>[Willpower]</color> for each stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Gash]</color> removed, up to a max of 160 <color=#FFFFFF>[Willpower]</color>. With at least 120 <color=#FFFFFF>[Willpower]</color>, she can consume 120 <color=#FFFFFF>[Willpower]</color> to use <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Bannerbearer - Converging Edge]</color>;
When a teammate triggers <color=#FFFFFF>[Maim]</color> and Sunbringer has enough <color=#FFFFFF>[Willpower]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Quick Assist]</color> is triggered. When Sunbringer switches on field via <color=#FFFFFF>[Quick Assist]</color>, she consumes 120 <color=#FFFFFF>[Willpower]</color> to instantly use <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Bannerbearer - Converging Edge]</color>. This effect can trigger once every 3s;
When Sunbringer's <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Bannerbearer - Converging Edge]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack: Night Blaze - End of the Long Dark]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack: Kindled Lamp - Measure of Eternity]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Ultimate: "This Journey, Onward Together"]</color>, and <color=#FFFFFF>[Ultimate: "This Wish, Reshape All Things"]</color> hit an enemy and deal DMG, the target accumulates <color=#FFFFFF>[Ember Scar]</color> equal to <color=#2BAD00>75%</color> of the actual DMG dealt by the skill. When the Finishing Move of Eldreda's <color=#FFFFFF>[Ultimate: "This Wish, Reshape All Things"]</color> hits an enemy, it removes all <color=#FFFFFF>[Ember Scar]</color> and directly deducts an equal amount of HP.
When an attack hits normal enemies whose <color=#FFFFFF>[Ember Scar]</color> is equal to or greater than their current HP, all of their <color=#FFFFFF>[Ember Scar]</color> is removed and they are instantly defeated.

