When a critical hit is triggered, Sharp DMG does not benefit from CRIT DMG Bonus and uses Laceration DMG Bonus instead. If CRIT Rate exceeds 100% and a critical hit has been triggered, an additional Laceration check is made based on the excess CRIT Rate. If Laceration triggers, Laceration DMG Bonus is applied one additional time. For every 1% of initial CRIT DMG Sunbringer has, Sunbringer's initial CRIT Rate increases by 0.35%;
When Sunbringer enters the battlefield, Sunbringer immediately recovers 60 Sharpness. In Investigation Zone mode, this effect can trigger once every 180s;
