After Dracaene activates a <color=#FFFFFF>[Defensive Assist]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Assist Follow-Up]</color> attacks launched by Eldreda and Lindverne gain <color=#2BAD00>15%</color> increased Gash Buildup Rate and deal <color=#2BAD00>20%</color> increased DMG;
