When Sunbringer enters combat, Sunbringer gains <color=#FFFFFF>[Midnight Sun]</color>, increasing CRIT Rate by <color=#2BAD00>40%</color> and ignoring <color=#2BAD00>20%</color> of the target's DEF when dealing DMG. <color=#FFFFFF>[Midnight Sun]</color> lasts 15s. While Eldreda and Lindverne are off field, its duration no longer decreases. Sunbringer regains <color=#FFFFFF>[Midnight Sun]</color> upon using any <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Bannerbearer - Converging Edge]</color>;
After Dracaene activates <color=#FFFFFF>[Defensive Assist]</color>, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Assist Follow-Up]</color> performed by Eldreda and Lindverne gains <color=#2BAD00>15%</color> increased Gash Buildup Rate and deals <color=#2BAD00>20%</color> more DMG;
Whenever any Agent in the squad triggers <color=#FFFFFF>[Maim]</color>, Sunbringer gains 40 <color=#FFFFFF>[Willpower]</color> for each stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Gash]</color> removed, up to a maximum of 160 <color=#FFFFFF>[Willpower]</color>. When Sunbringer has at least 120 <color=#FFFFFF>[Willpower]</color>, Sunbringer can consume 120 <color=#FFFFFF>[Willpower]</color> to activate <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Bannerbearer - Converging Edge]</color>;
When a teammate triggers <color=#FFFFFF>[Maim]</color>, if Sunbringer has enough <color=#FFFFFF>[Willpower]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Quick Assist]</color> is triggered. When Sunbringer switches on field via <color=#FFFFFF>[Quick Assist]</color>, 120 <color=#FFFFFF>[Willpower]</color> is consumed to directly activate <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Bannerbearer - Converging Edge]</color>. This effect can trigger once every 3s;
When Sunbringer's <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Bannerbearer - Converging Edge]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack: Night Blaze - End of the Long Dark]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack: Kindled Lamp - Measure of Eternity]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Ultimate: "This Journey, Onward Together"]</color>, or <color=#FFFFFF>[Ultimate: "This Wish, Reshape All Things"]</color> hits an enemy and deals DMG, the target accumulates <color=#FFFFFF>[Ember Scar]</color> equal to <color=#2BAD00>75%</color> of the actual DMG dealt by the skill. When the Finishing Move of Eldreda's <color=#FFFFFF>[Ultimate: "This Wish, Reshape All Things"]</color> hits an enemy, all <color=#FFFFFF>[Ember Scar]</color> is removed, directly deducting an equal amount of HP.
When an attack hits a normal enemy whose <color=#FFFFFF>[Ember Scar]</color> is greater than or equal to its current HP, all of its <color=#FFFFFF>[Ember Scar]</color> is removed and the enemy is instantly defeated.
